External SystemC dependency
---------------------------

The AT labs require a separately installed SystemC implementation. This
repository does not redistribute SystemC source code. Configure the build with a
local SystemC installation through variables such as SystemC_DIR,
CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH, SYSTEMC_ROOT, SYSTEMC_HOME, USER_SYSTEMC_ROOT,
USER_SYSTEMC_INCLUDE_DIR, or USER_SYSTEMC_LIB_DIR.

Protocol-shape references
-------------------------

The AT documentation records that a local Doulos AT example was consulted as a
protocol-shape reference during development. No Doulos source block or local
reference tree is redistributed by this repository.
